{"html_text": {"ja70:0.1": "<article id='ja70'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja70:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja70:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja70:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja70:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja70:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja70:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja70:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja70:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p>", "ja70:2.2": "<p class='endvagga'>{}</p>", "ja70:3.1": "<p class='uddana-intro'>{}</p>", "ja70:4.1": "<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja70:4.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja70:4.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja70:4.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja70:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja70:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja70:0.3": "Itthivagga ", "ja70:0.4": "10. Kuddālajātaka ", "ja70:1.1": "“Na taṁ jitaṁ sādhu jitaṁ, ", "ja70:1.2": "yaṁ jitaṁ avajīyati; ", "ja70:1.3": "Taṁ kho jitaṁ sādhu jitaṁ, ", "ja70:1.4": "yaṁ jitaṁ nāvajīyatī”ti. ", "ja70:2.1": "Kuddālajātakaṁ dasamaṁ. ", "ja70:2.2": "Itthivaggo sattamo. ", "ja70:3.1": "Tassuddānaṁ ", "ja70:4.1": "Sikhīsabbaghasopi ca vīṇavaro, ", "ja70:4.2": "Pisuṇā mittabhedikā nandī nadī; ", "ja70:4.3": "Mudulakkhaṇa sodariyā ca mano, ", "ja70:4.4": "Visa sādhujitena bhavanti dasāti. "}, "variant_text": {"ja70:0.1": "", "ja70:0.2": "", "ja70:0.3": "", "ja70:0.4": "", "ja70:1.1": "", "ja70:1.2": "", "ja70:1.3": "", "ja70:1.4": "", "ja70:2.1": "", "ja70:2.2": "Itthivaggo → itthīvaggo (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja70:3.1": "", "ja70:4.1": "", "ja70:4.2": "", "ja70:4.3": "", "ja70:4.4": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja70:0.1": "", "ja70:0.2": "", "ja70:0.3": "", "ja70:0.4": "", "ja70:1.1": "ms22J_153, msdiv70, pts-vp-pli1.313", "ja70:1.2": "", "ja70:1.3": "", "ja70:1.4": "", "ja70:2.1": "ms22J_154", "ja70:2.2": "", "ja70:3.1": "ms22J_155", "ja70:4.1": "csp1ed22.